Package: syncthing
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: continuous file synchronization program
 Syncthing synchronizes files between two or more computers in real
 time, safely protected from prying eyes. It works over any network,
 is easy to set up and runs on Linux, Windows and macOS.
 .
 This package ships only the syncthing binary and its documentation.
 The systemd service, the system user and the configuration ship in
 the keel-overlay-syncthing overlay, not in this package (handbook
 decision 0050).
